  "input": "Which note recorded the handover of the ledger to Cinder, and on what date?\n[2026-04-29] handover/2026-04-29-ledger: Cinder is taking over the ledger from team Boreal, effective today. Dashboards and alerts are being repointed. [2025-12-10] handover/2025-12-10-ledger: Atlas handed the ledger to the Boreal team today; Priya wrote up the handover doc for Lena. [2025-07-18] handover/2025-07-18-auth-gateway-correction: Correction to the handover note of 2025-07-01: auth-gateway went to team Boreal, not the Cinder team. Cinder never owned it; the note was written against the wrong team.",
